host is defined in [`/etc/nginx/sites-available/02-extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr.conf`](file:///etc/nginx/sites-available/02-extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr.conf):\n\n| Port | Protocol / Features | Target Host / Upstream | Purpose |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **80/TCP** | HTTP (`reuseport`) | `return 301 https://$host$request_uri;` | Plain HTTP to HTTPS redirect |\n| **443/TCP** | HTTPS (`http2 reuseport`) | `http://172.30.198.49` (Centreon Web) | Main reverse proxy |\n| **443/TCP** | Location `/` | `return 301 /centreon/;` | Explicit root redirection to Centreon UI |\n| **443/TCP** | Location `/lorawan/data` | `http://172.30.198.49:8443/lorawan/data` | LoRaWAN IoT telemetry ingest endpoint |\n| **9443/TCP** | HTTPS (`http2 reuseport`) | `http://172.30.198.50` (Centreon Map) | Dedicated Centreon Map backend |\n\n---\n\n### 4. SSL/TLS & Certificate Health\n\n* **Certificate**: Let's Encrypt (`extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr`)\n* **Serial**: `663fba1f2ebace31eb339a464ffd34a2dde`\n* **Validity**: Issued `Aug 19, 2026` — Expires <span style=\"color:green\">**Nov 17, 2026**</span> (**67 days remaining**)\n* **Protocols**: `TLSv1.2 TLSv1.3`\n* **Cipher Policy**: Mozilla Intermediate with ECDHE AEAD ciphers (`AES-GCM`, `CHACHA20-POLY1305`) and DH parameters (`dhparam.pem`).\n\n---\n\n### 5. Security & WAF Layer\n\n* **ModSecurity Web Application Firewall**: <span style=\"color:green\">**Active**</span> (`ngx_http_modsecurity_module.so` loaded, `908` inline rules applied via `/etc/nginx/modsec/main.conf`).\n* **Information Leak Prevention**: `server_tokens off;` enabled globally.\n* **Security Headers**: Managed centrally through `nginxconfig.io/security.conf`.\n\n---\n\n### Key Observations & Recommendations\n\n1. **Clean up `ssl_trusted_certificate` mismatch**:\n   * Currently, line 8 and line 73 of `02-extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr.conf` reference `DigiCertCA.crt`. Since the certificate was switched to Certbot/Let's Encrypt, this should either point to the Let's Encrypt chain (`/etc/letsencrypt/live/extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr/chain.pem`) or be commented out to eliminate the OCSP warning.\n2. **Upstream Keepalive**:\n   * The proxy configurations for `172.30.198.49` and `172.30.198.50` directly target raw IPs rather than named `upstream` blocks with `keepalive` pools. Defining upstream blocks with persistent HTTP/1.1 keepalive connections would reduce TCP handshake overhead to the Centreon backends.","thinking":"**Assessing Nginx Configuration & Status**\n\nDiagnostic output reveals an active Nginx instance (`nginx/1.18.0`) on the target host (`th2-revproxyp-fe1`). The presence of `ModSecurity-nginx v1.0.3` with 908 rules indicates a web application firewall is running. Systemd reports the service as active since July 2026. A warning regarding SSL stapling, potentially indicating a minor configuration issue, needs further investigation but is likely not critical to core functionality.\n\n\n"}
